IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mca-contracts`

-- Minors' Contracts Act 1987, ss 1 to 4 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_minors-contracts-act-1987.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a phone bought by a minor in 2024 on a guaranteed plan` MEANS Contract WITH
    `made on` IS 20240315
    `the Act applied to it under Civil Law Act s 5 before 12 November 1993` IS FALSE
    `it is unenforceable against the minor or the minor repudiates it` IS TRUE
    `that is because the party was a minor when it was made` IS TRUE
    `a guarantee was given for the minor's obligation` IS TRUE
    `the minor acquired property under it` IS TRUE
    `the minor still holds that property or property representing it` IS TRUE
    `the court thinks it just and equitable` IS TRUE

